<HandSpinnerLayout title="Hand Spinner Privacy Policy | nuunnu.com" description="Hand Spinner privacy policy: on-device trackpad input and preferences, Apple StoreKit purchases, and voluntary support messages.">
  <header class="legal-heading"><p class="eyebrow">HAND SPINNER / PRIVACY POLICY</p><h1>Nothing to track.</h1><p>Effective September 5, 2026<br />Developer: Natsuki Sato</p></header>
  <article class="legal-body">
    <section><h2>Your Mac. Your input.</h2><p>This policy covers the Hand Spinner macOS app and support for the app. Hand Spinner does not collect personal data through the app. It has no user accounts, advertising, analytics SDKs or third-party tracking.</p><p>Trackpad and pointer movement are processed only on your Mac to control the spinner. They are not recorded or transmitted to the developer.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Local preferences.</h2><p>The app saves preferences, such as your selected skin and whether you have completed the first-launch guide, locally on your Mac. These settings are not sent to a developer-operated server.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Purchases through Apple.</h2><p>Optional in-app purchases are handled by Apple StoreKit. The app checks Apple-signed transaction entitlements to unlock purchased skins and restore purchases. The developer does not receive your payment-card information or Apple Account password.</p><p>Apple’s processing of purchase and App Store information is governed by Apple’s own privacy terms.</p></section>
    <section><h2>If you contact support.</h2><p>If you email support, we receive the email address, message and any attachments you choose to send. We use that information to respond and troubleshoot your request, not for advertising or tracking. Please do not include passwords, payment details or unrelated personal information.</p><p>You can ask us to delete your support conversation by contacting <a href="mailto:wlknts28786@gmail.com">wlknts28786@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
    <section><h2>This website.</h2><p>These product, support and privacy pages do not require a login and do not add analytics, advertising or tracking scripts. The website hosting infrastructure may process ordinary request information, such as an IP address, to deliver and protect the site. That is separate from the app’s on-device input handling.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Updates &amp; contact.</h2><p>If this policy changes, we will publish the revised text and effective date on this page. For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:wlknts28786@gmail.com?subject=Hand%20Spinner%20Privacy">wlknts28786@gmail.com</a>.</p><p><a href="/works/hand-spinner/support/">Hand Spinner support →</a></p></section>
  </article>
</HandSpinnerLayout>
